<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna Bourse to include 3 new shares in EQOS.</title>
<headline>Vienna Bourse to include 3 new shares in EQOS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna Bourse said on Wednesday it would include three more shares in its electronic trading system EQOS, taking the total to 27 stocks.</p>
<p>From February 24 machine maker Auricon Beteiligungs AG, do-it-yourself chain bauMax AG and water purification firm BWT AG will be traded consecutively through EQOS, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Other recent additions to EQOS include points maker VAE AG, motorcycle manufacturer KTM Motorrad Holding AG and rubber maker Semperit Holding. --- Vienna Newsroom +43 1 531 12 275</p>
</text>
